  "body_html": "<p>Bring the excitement of the game right into your bedroom with a custom bedding option designed by Jeminise. This sports-themed comforter is the perfect addition for basketball players and sports enthusiasts of all ages, offering a cozy and stylish way to showcase your passion for the court.</p>\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Make it uniquely yours by customizing with your own Name and jersey Number for a personalized athletic look.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Cozy Feel:</strong> Crafted from 100% brushed polyester fabric with a whole-piece microfiber filling to prevent clumping or shifting.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water for quick drying and easy, hassle-free maintenance.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Lightweight Warmth:</strong> Lightweight yet durable, making it comfortable and cozy for all seasons.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Designed to fit standard US sizes including Twin, Full, Queen, and King.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Comforter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Cotton/ Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fill Material</th>\n<td>Microfiber</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Basketball D6</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Basketball Print</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>Name and Number (2 text inputs)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
